  "body": " Structured Instruction    Suggested Time 8 minutes  Objective To set out the method with one unknown region.     Key Takeaways & Teacher Connection   Connecting to Learner Work: parts (a) and (b) are the method: one unknown region, every region in terms of it, one equation.  Every person is in exactly one region, so the regions add up to the total.  Check the answer: no region may be negative.    "
