  "title": "Tea Grades.",
  "body": " Tea Grades   A tea packer mixes grade PF1 tea at Ksh a kilogram with grade BP1 at Ksh a kilogram, so that the blend costs Ksh a kilogram. In what ratio are they mixed?    PF1 is below the target and BP1 is above it. Crossing over:  PF1 : BP1 .  Check: .   "
