  "title": "How Much to Add?",
  "body": " How Much to Add?   A trader has of beans that cost Ksh a kilogram. How many kilograms of beans at Ksh must be added so that the mixture costs Ksh a kilogram?    Let kg be added. The total cost equals times the total mass:  so , and .  By the balance rule: , which gives the same answer.   "
