  "body": " Challenge: A Sixty-Degree Region  . Describe the region on one side of where angle . Is the point in front of the midpoint of in it?  Find the centre and radius of the arc on which angle , then how far in front of the arc reaches.  The region between and the arc of radius , arc included (solid). The arc is in front of , so the point is in the region (angle about ).  The arc has radius and its centre is on the perpendicular bisector, from . So the arc reaches in front of . Points inside the arc see at more than , and includes the arc. The point in front of is inside: angle .  "
