  "title": "Solving an Equation with Two Graphs.",
  "body": " Solving an Equation with Two Graphs  Plot and for on one grid and use the graphs to solve .        The graphs ( ) meet at , , , and . These are the solutions of in . The graphs give the solutions; finds solutions like these by algebra.   (solid) and (dashed) with their meeting points.   The graphs meet at 0, 60, 180, 300 and 360 degrees.  The solid curve y = sin 2x completes two waves between 0 and 360 degrees; the dashed curve y = sin x completes one. They meet at (0, 0), (60 degrees, 0.87), (180 degrees, 0), (300 degrees, -0.87) and (360 degrees, 0).      "
