  "title": "Challenge: Every Cubic Crosses.",
  "body": " Challenge: Every Cubic Crosses  Explain why every curve crosses the -axis at least once.  Think about large positive and large negative .  For large negative , is large and negative; for large positive , is large and positive. The curve has no breaks, so it must cross somewhere in between.  "
