  "title": "Problem-Solving and Discovery.",
  "body": " Problem-Solving and Discovery   Suggested Time 14 minutes  Objective Learners find that the distance a drone flies is not the same as its final displacement.  Teacher's Role Act out the motion: one learner walks along a tape line on the floor, east positive, following the table in part (a). Before calculating part (d), groups argue whether the answer is or and listen to each other's reasons (critical thinking).   "
