  "body": " Differentiation   Differentiation Strategies   Learner Group Strategy and Learning Experience  Struggling Learners (Support) Give a card: sketch , mark the times of rest, shade the parts and label them and . Work through and . Assign and .  On-Level Learners (Core) Full activity and all examples. Assign to .  Advanced Learners (Challenge) All exercises including . Extension: find the distance the particle in that exercise travels from to its second return to the origin.    Teacher note on the extension: split at the times of rest and . With , , and at , so the distance is .  "
